entries.body:
**Integration 2026-11-10 afternoon: main is at bfe581781**

**Landed since the last log**
- a1, round 5 (30b03a122):
  - about 70 Opus-reviewed pands;
  - own-look buurten up from 92 to 103.
- a1, facade-extras fix (d1436bdcc):
  - thinFade focal length;
  - registerFirst;
  - the register frontal strip spec.
- My TODO commits:
  - the house assembly line;
  - loose ends;
  - held branch-only installs (GG-West 6, GG-Zuid 4, Haarlemmerbuurt 9, Frederik Hendrik 9), which wait for `house:stage`.
- Q1 #335, test hygiene:
  - the `test:engine` flake (bakedCoarse read the real clock) went from 1/20 failing to 50/50 passing under load;
  - the two tree checks are green again and now part of `check:canal`;
  - a new `check:free-ride` for the S2/S5 specs;
  - the "Dutch cards" note was corrected, because its link still goes to en.wikipedia.

**House line**
- H2 #338 (Node preview) is accepted:
  - 1.5 s from cold, 0.1–0.2 s per re-render;
  - H2b is fixing the route the preview draws, the ride's lighting, the glazing measure and the 3/4 view.
- H4 #339 (crops) code is accepted, but its quality isn't:
  - the flags said 70 %, while about 40–55 % of crops are truly good;
  - H4b adds a wall-choice check, a size floor, a content check, white balance, 150 hand labels and best-of-N panorama years.
- H1 #337 (HouseSpec) is still running.
- The user asked for a Nassaukade demo and explanation. It will come from H7's demo bundle once the judgement session is happy with it.

**P6 #334 (tree tiles)**
- Tree-tile refetches are down from about 40 a minute to 0.
- iPhone tree rebuilds are 24–28 % faster than main.
- It is waiting on desktop heap at n = 3 (the bar is ≤ 575 MB) and on the shadow stills.

**For the user:** rotate the TypeSafe key.
